cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use code or data from this repository, please cite the paper it
  belongs to (given in each folder's README) and this repository.
title: >-
  CIPHA: code and data from the COVID-19 research of Combined Intelligence
  for Population Health Action, Cheshire and Merseyside
type: software
authors:
